:10Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86sCPkt"},{"body":"[General] The scope-based documentation filter still treats `io.opentelemetry.ratpack-1.7` as valid telemetry for the `ratpack-1.4` agent module (`instrumentation-docs/.../TelemetryParser.java:73`), and its test locks in that legacy alias. Since this change makes the agent emit `ratpack-1.4` unconditionally, remove that allow-list entry and update the parser test so stale legacy-scope data is no longer accepted.","comment_commit_id":"ddb839ed03b8ee23750f11797555f7513ee222b5","comment_id":4263317436,"key":"inline:4263317436","kind":"inline","line":28,"original_commit_id":"12750bbd88aa65e0520cdc8c3efaa9c576200efc","original_line":28,"path":"instrumentation/ratpack/ratpack-1.4/javaagent/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/ratpack/v1_4/httpclient/RatpackSingletons.java","review_commit_id":"12750bbd88aa65e0520cdc8c3efaa9c576200efc","review_id":5509143334,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-13T19:53:10Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"dce120735970498a2d1441351ba9065056a4cd8c35569424ef10896273b51ac9","id":4263317436,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-13T19:53:10Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86sCPle"},{"body":"[Javaagent] `JaxrsCodeAttributesGetter` is a stateless attributes getter, so retaining it as a singleton field conflicts with the repository convention and unnecessarily extends its lifetime. Keep it local to instrumenter registration, as the previous static initializer did.","comment_commit_id":"ddb839ed03b8ee23750f11797555f7513ee222b5","comment_id":4263317492,"key":"inline:4263317492","kind":"inline","line":28,"original_commit_id":"12750bbd88aa65e0520cdc8c3efaa9c576200efc","original_line":28,"path":"instrumentation/jaxrs/jaxrs-1.0-annotations/javaagent/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/jaxrs/v1_0/JaxrsSingletons.java","review_commit_id":"12750bbd88aa65e0520cdc8c3efaa9c576200efc","review_id":5509143334,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-13T19:53:10Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"14662837453344941200261bbb112e33b684b30eeb8c4bb04100248c872d3a84","id":4263317492,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-13T19:53:10Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86sCPmG"}],"frozen_at":1791939655,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-14T01:00:55Z","frozen_sha":"ddb839ed03b8ee23750f11797555f7513ee222b5","head_ref":"trask-v3-emitted-scopes-pr","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38493365183},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"Finalize the six emitted scope renames for JAX-RS, CXF/Metro JAX-WS, MongoDB, Ratpack HTTP client, and Tomcat JDBC. Update scope-based views and filters, for example:\n\n```diff\n- otel.scope.name=\"io.opentelemetry.tomcat-jdbc\"\n+ otel.scope.name=\"io.opentelemetry.tomcat-jdbc-8.5\"\n```\n\nThe changelog lists all six migrations.\n\nRemove the deprecated meter-based factories from the alpha `DbConnectionPoolMetrics` API. Use the `OpenTelemetry` factory instead:\n\n```java\nDbConnectionPoolMetrics.create(openTelemetry, \"my.instrumentation\", \"my-pool\", attributes);\n```\n\nPart of #20510.\n\n<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->","title":"Finalize Java agent instrumentation scope names"},"mode":"publish","pr":20584,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791939657,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"1ce025e6e5a1429fbefc949ff7126677","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210